  * Fix startup crash: define the tray command callback before creating TrayController.
  * Fix desktop activation so a stale active window cannot leave a blank player.
  * Record startup exceptions in ~/.cache/lunaplayer/startup.log for diagnosis.
  * Keep the tray-enabled setting consistent on startup.

  * Add optional system-tray indicator with open and quit actions.
  * Add a persistent System-Tray toggle; when enabled, closing the window hides
